    'The view definition to preview. Nothing is persisted. Unless `id` is given, at least one `all` condition must\nbe on "status", "type", "group_id", "assignee_id", "requester_id", "organization_id", "due_date",\n"support_type", one of the status duration fields ("OPEN", "PENDING", "HOLD", "CLOSED") or, on accounts with\ncustom statuses, "custom_status_id". Otherwise the definition is rejected as invalid. With `id` the referenced\nview\'s own conditions are merged in first and can satisfy the requirement on their own.\n',
